+## API access and audit
+
+Schema 3 stores `apiKeys` entries with `key`, `name`, and `role` and an
+`audit` array of successful API changes. Older files migrate with empty arrays;
+configure keys in the data file before using the API. Audit entries record
+`time`, `keyName`, `method`, `path`, and `status`.
